  title: "Esplanade \u2013 Theatres on the Bay \u2013 2002 "
  info: "Opened in 2002, the Esplanade is Singapore\u2019s premier arts and performance
    venue. Nicknamed the \u201CDurian\u201D due to its spiky, dome-shaped design,
    the Esplanade hosts concerts, theatre productions, and art exhibitions. It represents
    Singapore\u2019s commitment to cultural development and the performing arts.  "
